config UNITS
	bool "Support for the units literals library"
	select CPP
	help
	  This option enables the 'units' library, providing strongly-typed
	  physical quantities (Volts, Celsius, Millimeters, ...) via C++
	  user-defined literals, e.g. `48.0_v`, `23_celsius`.
